From 4594b476b50f46be8b709aa23692ec31e5995778 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 20:51:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple: support fragmented compact AFK messages

Split compact messages into bounded fragments and reassemble replies with length, interface and sequence validation. Serialize outgoing messages, implement ring-space requests and acknowledgements, and copy received entries before releasing ring storage.

Use allocations suitable for large service messages and reject truncated replies. Add a fragment-state selftest with optional native-trace replay.

Validation: affected objects build independently; ASan/UBSan tests pass, including replay of 77 native messages and a 256-fragment GetElements reply.

Assisted-By: OpenAI Codex (GPT-6 Astra)
Signed-off-by: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
